     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CodeSystem be-cs-telemonitoring-completed-status-reason</b></p><a name=\"be-cs-telemonitoring-completed-status-reason\"> </a><a name=\"hcbe-cs-telemonitoring-completed-status-reason\"> </a><p><b>Properties</b></p><p><b>This code system defines the following properties for its concepts</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td></tr><tr><td>snomed</td><td>snomed</td><td>Coding</td><td>Related SNOMED CT concept, when available</td></tr></table><p><b>Concepts</b></p><p>This case-insensitive code system <code>https://www.ehealth.fgov.be/standards/fhir/terminology/CodeSystem/be-cs-telemonitoring-completed-status-reason</code> defines the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>snomed</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">patient-non-compliant<a name=\"be-cs-telemonitoring-completed-status-reason-patient-non-compliant\"> </a></td><td>The patient does not comply with the conditions of telemonitoring.</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">patient-deceased<a name=\"be-cs-telemonitoring-completed-status-reason-patient-deceased\"> </a></td><td>The patient has died.</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-snomedct.html\" title=\"{http://snomed.info/sct 419099009}\">Dead</a></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">patient-requested-stop<a name=\"be-cs-telemonitoring-completed-status-reason-patient-requested-stop\"> </a></td><td>The patient has decided to stop telemonitoring.</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">medical-reasons<a name=\"be-cs-telemonitoring-completed-status-reason-medical-reasons\"> </a></td><td>Telemonitoring is stopped for medical reasons.</td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">patient-stabilised<a name=\"be-cs-telemonitoring-completed-status-reason-patient-stabilised\"> </a></td><td>The patient has stabilised.</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-snomedct.html\" title=\"{http://snomed.info/sct 161901003}\">Chronic sick</a></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">patient-transplanted<a name=\"be-cs-telemonitoring-completed-status-reason-patient-transplanted\"> </a></td><td>The patient received a transplant.</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-snomedct.html\" title=\"{http://snomed.info/sct 77465005}\">Transplantation to recipient</a></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">other<a name=\"be-cs-telemonitoring-completed-status-reason-other\"> </a></td><td>Other (free text).</td><td/></tr></table><p><b>Additional Language Displays</b></p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Deutsch (German, de)</b></td><td><b>French (Belgium) (fr)</b></td><td><b>Nederlands (België) (Dutch (Belgium), nl)</b></td></tr><tr><td>patient-non-compliant</td><td>Der Patient hält die Bedingungen des Telemonitorings nicht ein.</td><td>Le patient ne respecte pas les conditions de la télésurveillance.</td><td>De patiënt leeft de voorwaarden van telemonitoring niet na.</td></tr><tr><td>patient-deceased</td><td>Der Patient ist verstorben.</td><td>Le patient est décédé.</td><td>De patiënt is overleden.</td></tr><tr><td>patient-requested-stop</td><td>Der Patient hat beschlossen, das Telemonitoring zu beenden.</td><td>Le patient a décidé d'arrêter la télésurveillance.</td><td>De patiënt heeft besloten om telemonitoring stop te zetten.</td></tr><tr><td>medical-reasons</td><td>Das Telemonitoring wird aus medizinischen Gründen beendet.</td><td>La télésurveillance est arrêtée pour des raisons médicales.</td><td>De telemonitoring wordt om medische redenen stopgezet.</td></tr><tr><td>patient-stabilised</td><td>Der Patient ist stabilisiert.</td><td>Le patient est stabilisé.</td><td>De patiënt is gestabiliseerd.</td></tr><tr><td>patient-transplanted</td><td>Der Patient hat eine Transplantation erhalten.</td><td>Le patient a reçu une transplantation.</td><td>De patiënt kreeg een transplantatie.</td></tr><tr><td>other</td><td>Sonstiges (Freitext).</td><td>Autre (texte libre).</td><td>Andere (vrije tekst).</td></tr></table></div>"
